The `OwnerDto` is generated from this spec at build time; MapStruct's `OwnerMapper` (`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java`) auto-maps `getIdentityKey()` → the DTO's read-only `identityKey` field (no explicit mapping code — confirmed no identityKey/soundex references there). If you change the shape of these values, update the descriptions/examples here too.

